ach to gradually break down her defenses and lead her to accept her true self.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Risk Management</strong><br>If you push too hard and raise the alert level of a region, it may trigger intervention by \u2588\u2588\u2588, hindering your future actions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Character Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/Key-Individuals-in-This-Anomalous-Intervention.gif?t=1753301559\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Main Character</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Hana\uff5cIdol</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/\u7fbd\u5948.png?t=1753301559\" /></div>\u300c<i>As long as I keep smiling, no one will notice I'm about to break.</i>\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0A popular idol admired by the public, but inwardly crumbling. Desperate for dependency yet obsessed with control. Once her defenses fall, she will spiral out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Haruka Sasaki\uff5cHousewife</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/\u6674\u9999.png?t=1753301559\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300c<i>This home, this responsibility\u2026 am I truly content?</i>\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0A gentle and devoted homemaker hiding an unspeakable emptiness. Longing to be understood, yet afraid to take the first step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Momo\uff5cConbini girl</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/\u5c0f\u6843.png?t=1753301559\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300c<i>You think I fall for stuff that easily? Ehehe \u2665</i>\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lively girl working two part-time jobs. She appears carefree but is extremely sensitive to &quot;special attention.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Supporting Character</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Aya Hayashi\uff5cResearcher</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/\u6797\u7dbe.png?t=1753301559\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300c<i>...What exactly are you?</i>\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0A genius scientist with a deep fascination for all things abnormal. The most dangerous threat to any anomaly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 TsukumoMabuchi\uff5cBar Madam</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/\u771f\u6df5.png?t=1753301559\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Played by Tsukumo Mabuchi, a sensual VTuber from \u300c\u82a5\u5ddd\u7d44 Akutagawa\u300d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300c<i>Your eyes... are quite intriguing.</i>\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A calm, mysterious mature woman with wide-reaching connections. The hazy nights, when she's most relaxed, offer the perfect opportunity to breach her defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0YukinoshitaOriyuki\uff5cMasseuse</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/\u7e54\u96ea.png?t=1753301559\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Played by Yukinoshita Oriyuki, a sensual VTuber from \u300c\u82a5\u5ddd\u7d44 Akutagawa\u300d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u300c<i>Want to know where your stress comes from?</i>\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0An expert in guiding emotions through scent and touch, but mentally unstable\u2014making her a high-risk, easily influenced target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/More-content-will-be-revealed-in-future-\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2026.gif?t=1753301559\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/extras/\u8cc7\u6599\u5716_EN.png?t=1753301559\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0This is only the beginning.</strong></p>","developers":["AIROTS","\u975e\u9b5a\u5275\u610f "],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586530/cbc33b2e599612556bb442d6106bb0934674c92f/header.jpg?t=1753301559","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257143985,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143985/movie480.mp4?t=1753301554","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143985/movie_max.mp4?t=1753301554"},"name":"PV_EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257143985/15d66b7284b09c94e28515863905cce2803c52d7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753301554","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143985/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753301554","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143985/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753301554"}}],"name":"\u3010REDACTED\u3011\uff1aSexCP-069","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{